test "python authz: terminal length guard blocks a header-selected principal lookup"
  lang python
  reject VYQL-AUTH-095
  code
  ```
  from flask import request, session

  @app.route("/dashboard")
  def dashboard():
      user_id = session.get("user_id")
      requested_user_id = request.headers.get("X-User-Id")
      if requested_user_id:
          if User.query.get(requested_user_id):
              user_id = requested_user_id
          else:
              return ""
          if user_id:
              return ""
      if len(user_id) or len(requested_user_id):
          return ""
      user = User.query.get(user_id)
      return user
  ```

